{title: Tum Mile}
{artist: Tum Mile K K}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
[C]Khawabon binaa nigahein,        mere jee [Am]rahi thi
[F]Koi nahi tha yeh [G]akele,        mere thi [C]zindagi
[C]Khamoosh tha hothon,        py baaat [Am]nahi thi
[F]Koi nahi tha yeh [G],        akeli meri thi [C]zindagi
Tum [C]mile to mil gaya yeh jahan,        Tum [Am]mile to har pal hai naya
Tum [F]mile to sab se [G]hai [C]fasla,        Tum [C]mile to jadoo chaa gaya
Tum [Am]mile to jeenaa aa gaya,        Tum [F]mile to mene [G]paya hai [C]khuda
[C]Palkeein mundeein chahat,        meri so [Am]rahi thi
[F]Khushboo hawaon mein thi,        [G]mene nahi mehsoos [C]ki
[C]Janee kahan bahrein mere,        khil [Am]rahee the
[F]Khushboo hawaon mein thi,        [G]mene nahi mehsoos [C]ke
Tum [C]mile to mehke barishee,        Tum [Am]mile jagi khwaishe
Tum [F]mile to rango ka [G]hai [C]silsila,        Tum [C]mile to jadoo chaa gaya
Tum [Am]mile to jeena aa gaya,        Tum [F]mile to maine [G]paya hai [C]khuda
[C]Tunee duyain sune,        [Am]Dil ki sadyein sune
[F]Tujhse mein [G]maungu aur [C]kya,        [C]Tujh bin adhura hoon mein
[Am]Tere sang pura hoon mein,        [F]Karta hoon [G]tera [C]shukriya
[C]Kaise kahon.............. [Am],        [C]Kaise kahon.............. [Am]
[C]Kaise kahon lamhein mujhe,        choo [Am]rahein hain
[F]Aisa laga hai inmein,        [G]tera hi to ehsaas [C]hai
[C]Kaise kahon dil mein nayi,        [Am]aahtein hai
[F]Aisa laga hai inmein,        [G]tera hi to ehsaas [C]hai
Tum [C]mile to mera dil gaya,        Tum [Am]mile to sab kuch mil gaya
Tum [F]mile to logon se [G]kya [C]vasta,        Tum [C]mile to jadoo chaa gaya
Tum [Am]mile to jeena aa gaya,        Tum [F]mile to maine [G]paya hai [C]khuda
